+baseline and a few have signed deviations whose binomial contributions all have
+the same sign.  For each count, choose an odd cycle length L and an integer a
+coprime to L, then present a RAAG on N=m_i L generators in which precisely the
+pairs separated by a displayed cyclic step s=m_i a fail to commute.  Its
+complement has gcd(N,s)=m_i cycles.  This is inverse generation and composition
+of exact identities, not solution of the generated instance.
