The result is not yet shippable because OpenRouter returned HTTP 403 `Key limit exceeded` for all bare, hinted, and placebo requests before any oracle saw the problem. Consequently, G9 and `all_passed` remain honestly marked pending/false. No `REJECTED.md` was created because this is an infrastructure blocker, not a failure of G, H, or V.

