Definition source: the Introduction and Section 2 of Kishore--Singh,
"Matrix Waring Problem -- II" (arXiv:2205.04710) define the task as finding
A,B in M_m(F_q) with T=A^k+B^k.  Proposition A.3 gives q>k^16 for the
