The local artifact is now internally consistent and re-verified: G1–G8 pass, the exact answer language has 0 hits in 200,000 structure-aware samples, the reference algorithm performs 2,136,676 merge attempts on the shipping audit, all four no-tool attacks fail 0/8, and the compact route uses 178 exact operations. The only unresolved requirement is external: the fresh OpenRouter run was again rejected before any model saw the prompt (`HTTP 403: Key limit exceeded`). I’m preserving that as an error, not misreporting it as oracle failure.
