+The included reference implementation runs Proposition 4.2 literally after
+evaluating every Feistel-labelled edge. At provisional shipping `easy`, seed
+271828, it performs 327,680 edge iterations and 2,621,440 Feistel-round
+evaluations in 1.12 local seconds. Across the eight-seed G6 audit it solves 8/8
