+is a z in {0,...,N-1} with {a,b}={P(z),P((z+s) mod N)}; every other
+distinct pair commutes.  Thus each line is a complete exact RAAG
+presentation, not a sample.  Subscripts are zero-based and lines may
+appear in any order.
 
